From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] amstream: stream sample times/rect/APC updates, SetSameFormat, multimedia stream

Audio and DirectDraw streams: IStreamSample::SetSampleTimes stores the times;
Update accepts an event or an APC (queued to the calling thread when the update
completes; both together stay E_INVALIDARG) for audio samples too;
CompletionStatus on audio samples handles COMPSTAT_ABORT/NOUPDATEOK and WAIT;
IDirectDrawStreamSample::SetRect validates the rectangle against the surface,
refuses busy samples and makes the stream follow its size;
IMemInputPin::ReceiveMultiple feeds every sample to Receive. IMediaStream::
SetSameFormat copies the format of another audio or DirectDraw stream
(MS_E_INCOMPATIBLE for another kind, MS_E_NOSTREAM when that stream has no
format); AllocateSample/CreateSharedSample are E_NOTIMPL (samples come from
CreateSample) and SendEndOfStream is MS_E_INVALIDSTREAMTYPE on an input-only
stream.
IAMMultiMediaStream::GetInformation reports no flags and the stream type;
OpenMoniker binds the moniker to a source filter, adds it to the graph and
renders it like OpenFile; Render renders the opened source with the given flags
(E_UNEXPECTED when nothing was opened). The class factory's LockServer no longer
logs.
---
